# 📊 Retail Sales & Customer Analytics Dashboard

An end-to-end data analysis project focusing on retail sales performance, customer segmentation, and profit optimization using Python and Power BI.

## 🚀 Key Highlights
* **Data Cleaning & Preprocessing:** Handled missing values (including postal codes and customer records) and standardized data types using Python (`Pandas`).
* **Interactive Dashboard:** Designed a dynamic multi-page Power BI dashboard tracking KPIs, revenue trends, and regional performance.
* **Insights & Recommendations:** Identified top-performing product categories and high-value customer segments to boost profit margins.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
* **Data Manipulation & Cleaning:** Python, Pandas, NumPy
* **Data Visualization:** Power BI Desktop, Matplotlib
* **Database & Querying:** SQL Server / T-SQL

## 📈 Dashboard Overview
- **Overview Page:** Total Sales, Total Profit, Quantity Sold, and Profit Margins.
- **Customer Segmentation:** Breakdown between individual retail clients and corporate accounts.
- **Geographic Analysis:** Regional sales performance mapping and shipping mode efficiency.

